% expect-output: 1
% divergence: server-password-default
% Scenario: exitserver with the right password. The default server
% password is 0; the dictionary stack is back at the permanent
% dictionaries, so a definition made after leaving the server loop
% lands in userdict and is still there later in the run.
% Expect: 1.
serverdict begin 0 exitserver
/persist 1 def
persist =
